# Trained models are build outputs, reproducible via `make train`.
# model.pkl is committed: it is 1.2 MB and the app and Docker image need it.
# The 1.3 GB of competition data stays out.
# reports/figures/ is committed on purpose: the README embeds those five PNGs,
# and they were ignored here, so every image in the README rendered broken.
artifacts/*.txt

# 14 MB and regenerable via `make submit`; the code is what matters, not the file.
reports/submission.csv
